---
layout: base.njk
trackId: ibhl
title: "IB Math HL (AA/AI) · ClipSAT"
description: "IB Mathematics Higher Level — algebra, complex numbers, 3D vectors, statistics and calculus for both AA and AI"
isRtl: false
---
{#
  Renders from content/ibhl/* (docs/CONTENT_MODEL.md) instead of the legacy
  {% include "tracks/ibhl.html" %} — twelfth track cut over, following the established pattern
  (docs/DECISIONS/0005-qudrat-cutover.md through 0010). index.html (deleted, WP10 step 4 — docs/DECISIONS/0023; still recoverable via
  git history) and src/_includes/tracks/ibhl.html (also deleted, same step) used
  to be kept as an inert rollback path — no longer needed once every track had been
  migrated and verified live.

  Notes (WP24): shares ibsl's real bug (orphaned always-visible content outside any .chapter
  wrapper) and its fix (restored into the chapter each block topically belongs to), its
  chapterTag pill shape (per-badge classes), and its testGenerator/downloadsInfo 'ib' variants —
  same IB site family, verified fresh rather than assumed identical. Two real per-track/per-chapter
  differences from ibsl: (1) ibhl-t3's explorer is the lazy-loaded WebGL/Three.js 3D shape
  (course_schema.json's explorerBlock.canvas3d, new this track — see docs/DECISIONS/0011), not a
  plain canvas; (2) the rail has a real, track-EXCLUSIVE "Curriculum Mapping" <select> widget
  (window.CSGamify.mapCurriculum) found on no other track, not even ibsl — passed to rail.njk as
  literal railExtra markup rather than new schema fields for a one-instance feature. ibhl-aa's and
  ibhl-aihl's rail labels ("AA/AI HL Extensions") differ from their own h2 text ("AA/AI HL —
  Additional Topics"), same railLabel override mechanism ibsl's "ai" chapter needed. None of the 4
  downloads resourceCards are 'wide' this time (ibsl had 2) — real per-track difference, the field
  already defaults to false.
#}
{% set ibhl = migratedContent.ibhl %}
{% set pageHeader = ibhl.meta.meta.pageHeader %}
{% set railExtra %}
<div class="mapper-wrap">
  <span class="mapper-label">Curriculum Mapping</span>
  <select class="nav-select" id="curriculum-select" aria-label="Curriculum mapping" onchange="window.CSGamify.mapCurriculum(this.value)">
    <option value="default">ClipSAT Standard</option>
    <option value="reveal-precalc">Reveal Pre-Calculus</option>
    <option value="cambridge-igcse">Cambridge IGCSE 0580</option>
    <option value="collegeboard-sat">Digital SAT (College Board)</option>
  </select>
</div>
{% endset %}
<main id="view-ibhl" class="view active">
  {% include "partials/subject-head.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap calc-body">
    {% set chapters = ibhl.chapters %}
    {% set practiceSetId = 'ibhl-practice' %}
    {% set testGeneratorId = 'ibhl-testgen' %}
    {% set downloadsId = 'ibhl-downloads' %}
    {% include "partials/rail.njk" %}

    <div class="content">
      {% for chapter in ibhl.chapters %}
        {% include "partials/chapter.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% set sectionId = 'ibhl-practice' %}
      {% set practiceSet = ibhl.practiceSet %}
      {% include "partials/practice-set.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'ibhl-testgen' %}
      {% set testGenerator = ibhl.meta.meta.testGenerator %}
      {% include "partials/test-generator.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'ibhl-downloads' %}
      {% set courseMeta = ibhl.meta.meta %}
      {% include "partials/downloads-block.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
